{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make some tea, dim the lights, and get lost in a patchwork world where every tile hides a tale.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Lapin, a curious bunny girl, across a magical patchwork world - one mysterious tile at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a 100-tile board filled with whimsical encounters, tough decisions, and stats-driven exploration. Each run reshuffles the map and its story. Will you thrive on luck, logic, or sheer bunny stubbornness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you thrive on luck, logic, or sheer bunny stubbornness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is a self-contained journey, full of colour, stats-based gambles, and little stories. Play again and again to uncover new tiles, write new stories, and let your bunny girl explore more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/39916c02f6663eeacca12fd79292ab7d.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a 100-tile board one space at a time - each run reshuffles the map and the fate ahead by picking from 5 regions, 6 variations and\u00a0 over 400 stories.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/56f709a9c1e50f44b2965561b004c8c7.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/71c8f2ee3111452266de91c8a9509ace.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outcomes depend on your strengths, rewards you won and a little bit of luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/2d8de6f2dec5d11d72f785868fb7415f.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/b5fcb5b1c9b7a1310bcd957001fa510b.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Lapin, a curious bunny girl through cozy and fantastical encounters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/054e02434ad412c2d2f1369d0f86aa1f.avif?t=1749834306\" width=330 height=128 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640130?t=1749834306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/8cf6c80179dacf649b5241e566bbac4f9dc4970b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749834306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/87109a641f05e30a543b7b32ecf5774ef178f6fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749834306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/87109a641f05e30a543b7b32ecf5774ef178f6fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749834306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam 